[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Public Low Level Requirements
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-LOW-LEVEL-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PLLR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: VERIFICATION_METHOD
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Test, Inspection)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Refines
    REVERSE_ROLE: Refined By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-APP-ROOT
TITLE: Public App Root

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-APP-ROOT-ELEMENT
TITLE: App Root

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-4
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL contain a Header host, an Announcements Bar when the App Root shows that bar, a Page Outlet, and a Footer host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root composes those subelements so Header, Footer, announcements, and the active public page share one shell. Header and Footer contents are separate requirements. When the App Root shows the Announcements Bar is a separate requirement.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-20
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL fill the entire viewport.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root is the outermost shell of the public page. Filling the viewport gives Header, page content, and Footer a full-page layout that resizes with the viewport.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-21
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL use the white theme token for its background and the sans-serif theme font for its text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The outermost site layer uses a white background and a sans-serif default. Theme tokens supply those values.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-HOST
TITLE: Header Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-5
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL hold the Public Frontend Header.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root supplies a host so Header implementation mounts in the public shell. Header contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-22
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL stick to the top of the viewport while the visitor scrolls.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages keep the Header at the top. Sticking the host keeps that top placement as the visitor scrolls.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-23
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host is an empty mount for Header contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until Header paints its own presentation. Independent Header host colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-FOOTER-HOST
TITLE: Footer Host

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-6
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL hold the Public Frontend Footer.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root supplies a host so Footer implementation mounts in the public shell. Footer contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-24
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL sit at the bottom of the App Root.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages place the Footer at the bottom. The host anchors that placement in the App Root.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-25
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer host SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Footer host is an empty mount for Footer contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so the shell stays consistent until Footer paints its own presentation. Independent Footer host colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-PAGE-OUTLET
TITLE: Page Outlet

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-7
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL render the active public page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Public pages mount through the Page Outlet so each page shares the App Root shell. Page contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-26
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL sit between the Header host and the Footer host and SHALL grow to fill the remaining App Root space.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placing the outlet between the hosts and letting it grow keeps Header and Footer at the edges while page content uses the middle of the shell as the viewport resizes.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-27
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Page Outlet SHALL inherit the App Root font and text color theme tokens.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Page Outlet is a mount for page contents. It inherits App Root type tokens so pages share the shell defaults until a page sets its own presentation. Independent Page Outlet colors are not set yet.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-ANNOUNCEMENTS-BAR
TITLE: Announcements Bar

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-15
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL display the title and text of each urgent public announcement it receives, and SHALL open the home page announcements display focused on an announcement when the visitor selects that announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The bar presents urgent announcement contents and routes the visitor to that announcement on the home page. Title and text refine the urgent announcement contents. Selection refines urgent announcement selection.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-30
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-31
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-34
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-16
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The App Root SHALL show the Announcements Bar between the Header host and the Page Outlet on every public page other than the home page when there is an urgent public announcement to display, and SHALL omit the Announcements Bar on the home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Container belongs on non-home public pages when an urgent announcement exists. The home page uses the Announcements Display instead. Placement under the Header host keeps the bar in the shared shell.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-27
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-47
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-17
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL use the cream theme token for its background, the gray theme token for its bottom border, the dark-green theme token for announcement titles, and the dark-brown theme token for announcement text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Theme tokens keep announcement presentation aligned with the organization palette. A fuller color role map for the bar is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-47
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-MODULES
TITLE: Modules

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER
TITLE: Public Header

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-ELEMENT
TITLE: Header

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-46
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL present the Header Logo, the Header Organization Name when the layout permits, the Header account-access controls, the Header Contact control, and the Header Site Search control.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header composes those displayed elements in the Header host. Each element's behavior is a separate requirement.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). REVIEW_STATUS stays Changed until owner approval.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-47
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL fill the Header host and arrange identity and Header actions in a horizontal bar that wraps as the viewport narrows.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header host already sticks to the top of the viewport. Filling that host and wrapping the bar keeps Header contents available as the page resizes.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-48
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Header SHALL use the light-green theme token for its background, the gray theme token for its bottom border, and the dark-green theme token for its text.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Theme tokens keep Header presentation aligned with the organization palette. A fuller color role map for the Header is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed Lexical mapping for owner review until a full color role map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-LOGO
TITLE: Logo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-49
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL display the GSSC Logo.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header always includes the GSSC Logo so the visitor can identify the society.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). Logo artwork may be an SVG mark until a brand file is supplied.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-50
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL appear at the start of the Header in every layout.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Leading placement keeps the logo visible whether or not the organization name also fits.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-51
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Logo SHALL use the dark-green theme token for its mark color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A single theme token keeps the mark readable on the Header background until a brand color role is set.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-1
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-ORG-NAME
TITLE: Organization Name

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-52
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL display the name Genealogical Society of Stanislaus County, or the acronym GSSC, when the layout permits.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Header includes the society name when there is room. The acronym is the short form when the full name does not fit and the layout still permits a name.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). Proposed layout bands: full name when the Header is at least 48rem wide; acronym when at least 30rem and under 48rem; omit the name under 30rem (logo remains).
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-53
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL appear beside the Header Logo when the layout permits a name, and SHALL be omitted from the Header when the layout does not permit a name.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Placement beside the logo keeps identity together. Omitting the name on a narrow layout leaves the logo as the identity mark.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-54
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Organization Name SHALL use the sans-serif theme font, a medium font weight, and the dark-green theme token for its text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Those tokens keep the name aligned with Header text presentation until a fuller type role map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-19
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-LOGIN
TITLE: Login

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-55
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When no member is logged in, the Header Login control SHALL navigate the visitor to the members-only application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Login on the public Header is navigation to the Member Frontend. Member Frontend UI is out of this requirement's scope.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-22). Proposed default members origin for local development: http://localhost:4201.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-56
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Login control SHALL appear in the Header account-access area when no member is logged in, and SHALL be omitted when a member is logged in.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Login belongs with account access. Member Access replaces Login when a member is logged in.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-57
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Login control SHALL use the sans-serif theme font and the dark-green theme token for its text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Account-access controls share Header text tokens until a fuller control style map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-2
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-HEADER-MEMBER-ACCESS
TITLE: Member Access

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-58
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
When a member is logged in, the Header Member Access control SHALL navigate the visitor to the members-only application.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member reaches the Member Frontend through Member Access instead of Login.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
