- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-59
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Member Access control SHALL appear in the Header account-access area in place of the Header Login control when a member is logged in, and SHALL be omitted when no member is logged in.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Member Access replaces Login rather than appearing beside it.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-60
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Header Member Access control SHALL use the sans-serif theme font and the dark-green theme token for its text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Account-access controls share Header text tokens until a fuller control style map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-22
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-18
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

