[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-28
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Frontend Footer SHALL contain the Organization Name, Phone Number, Email Address, Postal Address, and Contact control.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Footer presents those society identity and contact elements together in the public shell. Each element's behavior is a separate requirement. Contact overlay contents are a separate feature.
<<<
