  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-26
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-29
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer SHALL fill the Footer host across the full width of the App Root.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages place the Footer at the bottom of the page. Filling the Footer host keeps that Footer edge-to-edge as the viewport resizes.
<<<
