  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-30
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer SHALL use the black theme token for its background and the white theme token for its default text color.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Black and white theme tokens set a high-contrast Footer chrome. A fuller color role map for the Footer is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
