[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-FOOTER-ORGANIZATION-NAME
TITLE: Organization Name

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-31
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer Organization Name SHALL display the society's organization name or organization acronym from the Society Contact service.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Footer shows one organization-name form at a time from the Society Contact service. Which form is visible by site width is a separate Lexical requirement.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-23
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-21
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-32
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer Organization Name SHALL appear at the start of the Footer content.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Leading with the organization name identifies the Footer before the contact details.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-23
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-21
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-33
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer Organization Name SHALL use a semibold weight and the white theme token for its text color, SHALL show the organization name at small and above, and SHALL show the organization acronym below small.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Semibold white text distinguishes the organization name within the Footer. Showing the acronym below small and the full name at small and above keeps the label readable as the viewport narrows or widens.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-23
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-21
  ROLE: Refines

