UID: GSSC-PLLR-FOOTER-PHONE-NUMBER
TITLE: Phone Number

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-34
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer Phone Number SHALL display the society's phone number from the Society Contact service and SHALL dial that number when the visitor selects it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Footer shows the phone number separately from the Contact overlay and lets the visitor dial it. The Society Contact service supplies the number. This requirement does not set the current number.
<<<
