VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-23
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-24
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-36
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Footer Phone Number SHALL use a normal weight and the white theme token for its text color, with no underline except on hover.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Normal-weight white text keeps the telephone link readable on the Footer background. Underline on hover marks it as activatable without a default underline. A fuller type scale is not set yet beyond this weight and token choice.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-23
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-24
  ROLE: Refines

